1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
An equation pops up...

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:03,560
one sign is missing!

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,600
This is Missing Sign!

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:10,620
Pick the operator that makes the equation true!

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:17,620
Twelve, question mark, three, equals four — that's divide!

6
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:21,340
Twelve divided by three is four!

7
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:28,220
Nine, question mark, two, equals eleven — that's plus!

8
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:31,160
Nine plus two is eleven!

9
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:37,000
Get it right, the sign locks in, and a new equation pops up fast!

10
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:43,880
Parents — this builds real operation sense, so kids see how the four operations connect!

11
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:51,280
Find it in the app — tap Math Game Zone, pick Missing Sign, choose your level, and play!

12
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:55,600
Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
